    "quoteText": "ΠΕΡΑΣ ΕΠΙΤΕΛΕΙ ΜΗ ΑΠΟΔΕΙΛΙΩΝ",
    "quoteTextEN": "Carry it through to the end, without flinching.",
    "quoteDescription": "From the Stobaeus list of Delphic maxims.",
